N:HOW READ (2026-11-11): Bars 1-3, 5-7, 9-11 and 13-15 contain eight eighth units; bars 4, 8, 12 and 16 change to 3/4 and contain six. Melody uses D mixolydian, D4-B4, largest leap a fifth. Bars 1-4 are unison; 5-8 add chordal support; 9-12 add an independent counterline; 13-16 use the selected cumulative, swapped or subtractive texture. Form is four related four-bar panels.
N:UNCERTAIN: Mixed-ensemble balance, metre readability, voice range, student authorship process, originality and whether the final texture choices are meaningfully distinct require the named reviews and trial.
